                                                <paragraph>One or more functions that will be called with the input config prior
                                                    to the wrapped function. An iterable of pre-call functions are called
                                                    from left (low-index) to right (high-index).</paragraph>
                                                <paragraph>This is useful, e.g., for seeding a RNG prior to the instantiation phase
                                                    that is triggered when calling the wrapped function.</paragraph>
                                            </definition>
