                                                    interpolated fields resolved prior to being passed to any pre-call
                                                    functions. Otherwise, the interpolation occurs after the pre-call functions
                                                    are called.</paragraph>
                                            </definition>
                                        </definition_list_item>
                                        <definition_list_item>
