                                            <definition>
                                                <paragraph>(positional only) A config object or yaml-string whose attributes will be
                                                    extracted by-name according to the signature of <literal classes="xref py py-obj">func</literal> and passed to <literal classes="xref py py-obj">func</literal>.</paragraph>
                                                <paragraph>Attributes of types that can be instantiated by Hydra will be instantiated
